{
  "_about": [
    "Per-source reuse policy for the News feed (save-trends.mjs). The feed always shows title + link to the source.",
    "summary: may we show the article description (og:description, <=280 chars)?  image: may we show the article og:image?",
    "Both default to false. Turn one on ONLY after recording where the permission comes from in evidence",
    "(terms-of-service URL / license / written agreement) and the date in checked. An open OG tag is not permission.",
    "Unknown sources fall back to _default. Video thumbnails come from the YouTube API and are not governed here."
  ],
  "_default": {
    "summary": false,
    "image": false
  },
